# Build artifacts of pkcs11-mock (added in Phase 0)
src/**/runtimes/**/native/

# Build trees created *inside* a submodule (SoftHSM's _at_build/_cmake_build, pkcs11-mock's build/,
# NSS's out/) are hidden with `ignore = untracked` per-submodule in .gitmodules — a superproject
# .gitignore cannot reach a submodule's own working tree. Only paths the superproject itself owns
# belong here: vendor/dist/ is NSS build.sh output emitted as a plain sibling of the submodule.
vendor/dist/
